&_nc_oc=AdpFe0ZUjCoSeIxB9v-rWH-CNCEnu7Ae1B2fZ8sS0N5YMn7Xo-aaHT3mzu4kz67w3jE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQM9eGefC4GNVaspgBFTllQt6iCkHJH6u4gsIjgwUOQ8qA&oe=6AE5FD34"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Landscape2.png", "id": "2174284356447643", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/604310912_2174284359780976_2381955425695884834_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=MeW9Jv0q5AoQ7kNvwFzhjBd&_nc_oc=AdqYOCj-AV1HMWGgvRerqfLq68cxpq-gV-2lzzDZqsfJHmVdBOLmSTyqVuwyMDZ_ckE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQOL2GAZ6ux5M9gjAOmfs-IKH3lsGNfKpZWtUi1aec_b6Q&oe=6AE60ED1"}, "display_name": "Jigsaw Puzzle Customizable", "keywords": ["Jigsaw", "Puzzle", "Customizable", "Riddle", "Challenge"], "long_description": "A Jigsaw Puzzle is a tiling puzzle that requires the assembly of irregularly shaped interlocking and mosaicked pieces. Each piece has a portion of a picture, which is completed by solving the puzzle.\n\nThis VR Game presents a 10 x 7 = 70 pieces Jigsaw Puzzle with the posibility to choose between 20 default image templates and you can also add you own custom images on the directory:\n\nAndroid\\data\\com.midicreations.jigsawpuzzle\\files\n\nAnd will appear automcatically on the Main Menu as a template to choose from as a template.\n\nThe game is presented on a elegant library scenario, and the time you took to solve the Puzzle is measured to update your own score of best time (Minimum time to solve the puzzle).", "short_description": "A jigsaw puzzle is a tiling puzzle that requires the assembly of irregularly shaped interlocking and mosaicked pieces. Each piece has a portion of a picture, which is completed by solving the puzzle."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://midicreationsvr.blogspot.com/p/1.html?name=Jigsaw+Puzzle+Customizable", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Midi Creations", "su